version 3
run Baseline-5-20261112-17:12:36-22014
attr configname Baseline
attr datetime 20261112-17:12:36
attr datetimef 20261112-171236
attr experiment Baseline
attr inifile omnetpp.ini
attr iterationvars $N=40
attr iterationvarsd N=40
attr iterationvarsf N=40-
attr measurement $N=40
